      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2298647161643049540, guid: 0222a1b4f9c504f4cb194ba535c119ea, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "That\u2019s Correct!\n\nFrom 8 warriors, choosing 4 is written using
        combination notation as:\n\n_8C_4\n\nFrom 6 mages, choosing 3 is written
        as:\n\n_6C_3\n\nSince both selections must happen together, we multiply:\n\n_8C_4
        x _6C_3\n\n= 70 x 20\n\n= 1400\n\nSo, the team can be formed in 1400 different
        ways."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
